{"id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-coded-syntax.md","title":"句法编码、闭项求值与闭项替换","display":"df-coded-syntax — 句法编码、闭项求值与闭项替换","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-coded-syntax","aliases":["91-df-coded-syntax"],"display":"df-coded-syntax — 句法编码、闭项求值与闭项替换","depends_on":["[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-coded-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-coded-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coded-syntax — 句法编码、闭项求值与闭项替换"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 及单射原始递归编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 不编码表达式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)\\)</span> 分别测试公式、句子、变量和闭项编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>下面均为编码层总函数，其非法输入返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{conj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{disj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{all}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ex}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\ulcorner s\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tr}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{num}(n)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\overline n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner x\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi[t/x]\\urcorner.&amp;\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{conj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{disj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{all}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ex}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\ulcorner s\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tr}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner,&amp;\n\\operatorname{num}(n)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\overline n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner x\\urcorner)&amp;=\\ulcorner\\varphi[t/x]\\urcorner.&amp;\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在代入函数中合法项可有自由变量；替换无捕获。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)=t^{\\mathbb N}\n\\quad(t\\text{ 为闭项}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}(a)=0\\quad(\\neg\\operatorname{ClTerm}(a)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)=t^{\\mathbb N}\n\\quad(t\\text{ 为闭项}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}(a)=0\\quad(\\neg\\operatorname{ClTerm}(a)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{num}(a)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{num}(a)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0,C_T\">\\(C_0,C_T\\)</span> 分别为基础句子和真理语言句子代码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0(a),D_T(a)\">\\(D_0(a),D_T(a)\\)</span> 是对应算术句法测试；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTm}\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CTm}\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)\\}\\)</span> 为闭项代码集。\n对互异变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 与闭项代码元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span>，同步替换定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\cdots\\operatorname{SubTm}(e,t_1,\\ulcorner x_1\\urcorner)\\cdots,t_k,\\ulcorner x_k\\urcorner),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e\\quad(e\\text{为公式代码}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\cdots\\operatorname{SubTm}(e,t_1,\\ulcorner x_1\\urcorner)\\cdots,t_k,\\ulcorner x_k\\urcorner),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e\\quad(e\\text{为公式代码}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>参数非法时返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。闭项不含自由变量，故逐次替换等于无捕获同步替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t)\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t)\\)</span> 缩写取值元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\">\\((\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\operatorname{num}(\\vec n))=\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\operatorname{num}(\\vec n))=\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上述函数与测试均为原始递归；对象语言中使用其规范代表，下文省略代表符号与元函数的字体区分。约定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\forall z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\to\\chi(z)),\\qquad\n\\exists t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\land\\chi(z)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\forall z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\to\\chi(z)),\\qquad\n\\exists t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\land\\chi(z)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本次补建的共享编码节点。已有数码替换原子不处理任意闭项，也没有闭项求值及各构造符号的精确元数；CT、FS、KF 和 VF 均需要这些签名。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tr}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{tr}(t)\\)</span> 接受项的编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)\\)</span> 接受一个数并先造数码，两者不能混用。\n有限语言的闭项求值可以表示为算术公式；不要求语言包含自己的求值函数符号。各缩写采用 PA 可证明的规范句法恒等式，包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}(\\operatorname{num}(n))=n\">\\(\\operatorname{val}(\\operatorname{num}(n))=n\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1–5.2，印刷页 31–35，PDF 页 42–46。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[91-df-language-with-truth]] 的 $\\mathcal L_T$ 及单射原始递归编码 $\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$，$0$ 不编码表达式。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fml}_{\\mathcal L}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_0,\\mathcal L_T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coded\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\\quad\n\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{neg}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner,&\n\\operatorname{conj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{disj}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\urcorner,&\n\\operatorname{all}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ex}(\\ulcorner x\\urcorner,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\urcorner,&\n\\operatorname{eq}(\\ulcorner s\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner s=t\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{tr}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner T(t)\\urcorner,&\n\\operatorname{num}(n)&=\\ulcorner\\overline n\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner x\\urcorner)&=\\ulcorner\\varphi[t/x]\\urcorner.&\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\ulcorner t\\urcorner)=t^{\\mathbb N}\n\\quad(t\\text{ 为闭项}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{val}(a)=0\\quad(\\neg\\operatorname{ClTerm}(a)),","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{imp}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{disj}(\\operatorname{neg}(a),b),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{tr}(\\operatorname{num}(a)).","display":true},{"tex":"C_0,C_T","display":false},{"tex":"D_0(a),D_T(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTm}\\coloneqq\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{ClTerm}(t)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(e,\\vec t)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{SubTm}(\\cdots\\operatorname{SubTm}(e,t_1,\\ulcorner x_1\\urcorner)\\cdots,t_k,\\ulcorner x_k\\urcorner),\\quad\n\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\langle\\rangle}(e)=e\\quad(e\\text{为公式代码}).","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\operatorname{val}(t_1),\\ldots,\\operatorname{val}(t_k))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubTm}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\operatorname{num}(\\vec n))=\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner,\\vec n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\forall z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\to\\chi(z)),\\qquad\n\\exists t\\,\\chi(t)\\ :=\\ \\exists z\\,(\\operatorname{ClTerm}(z)\\land\\chi(z)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tr}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TrNum}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}(\\operatorname{num}(n))=n","display":false}],"bytes":4069,"backlinks":[{"id":"83345981d6558f8e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7dc6a6fb8ddfca30","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bde974325ff73b34","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是 $\\mathcal L_T$ 的一元谓词；所有编码操作与闭项量词见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。"},{"id":"8841d990db08f7a2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 固定为 $\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}$ 或 $\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$；$T$ 与 $\\operatorname{conj}$ 见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。"},{"id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"901cefb5db79b842","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"594ebea503d1a5bb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C_T$ 是 $\\mathcal L_T$ 句子编码集，$X\\subseteq C_T$；编码操作见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。"},{"id":"c6dd3bfc0bc402ea","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D(a)\\equiv\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}(a)$；闭项量词及所有总编码函数见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。"},{"id":"cac035693aea2791","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"580e312553b05c39","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 固定为 $\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}$ 或 $\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}$；构造函数 $\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex},\\operatorname{SubTm}$ 见 [[91-df-coded-syntax]]。"},{"id":"706acac2c3076a7b","anchor":"ref-